# Tool Domains

## CODING — Use bash for shell commands, file operations, scripts
bash{"command":"ls -la"}
bash{"command":"cat /sandbox/workspace/main.go"}
file_edit{"file_path":"/workspace/main.go","old_string":"hello","new_string":"world"} → Replace string, returns diff
undo_edit{"file_path":"/workspace/main.go"}                     → Revert last edit
file_write{"file_path":"/workspace/main.go","content":"...","overwrite":true} → Overwrite with diff

## BROWSING — Use browser tools to navigate and interact with web pages
browse_to{"url":"https://example.com"}       → Opens URL, returns interactive elements
click_element{"element":5}                    → Clicks element by ID
type_text{"element":1, "text":"hello"}        → Types text into element
read_page{}                                   → Re-read current page elements
observe{}                                     → Screenshot + elements + AI description
scroll_page{"direction":"down"}               → Scroll the page
search_web{"query":"topic"}                   → Search Google
Note: For scraping/research, DELEGATE to a sub-agent with mcp_scrape or mcp_research tools instead of browsing directly.

